window.products.push({"id":664069,"name":"Bonavita Connoisseur 8-Cup One-Touch Coffee Maker Featuring Hanging Filter Basket and Thermal Carafe, BV1901TS w/Two Small Wooden Stirring Spoons & On","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YPXveCs7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Bonavita 8-cup Carafe Coffee Brewer Powerful and Precise 1500-watt Heater. A crucial step in brewing great coffee is reaching—and maintaining—the optimal water temperature. Water that's too hot or too cold produces an imbalanced flavor profile and other undesirable qualities. Bonavita brewers are fitted with a powerful and precise heater that reaches the optimal temperature quickly and maintains that temperature throughout the brew. This results in faster brewing and, of course, delicious coffee. Recognized by the SCA. Specialty Coffee Association Certified Home Brewer. Gold-Cup Quality Brewing. Bonavita's coffee brewers are tested and approved by the Specialty Coffee Association as part of its Certified Home Brewer program. It's a certification bestowed on only a handful of exemplary machines that meet the SCA's rigorous technical standards. Simple Design for Consistent Results The ingredients for great coffee are simple: fresh coffee, pure filtered water, and you. At Bonavita we believe simple is good, so we've refined our coffee brewers down to the essential elements needed to brew great coffee. Simple operation means it's easy to brew a quality pot of coffee every time. The Bonavita 8-cup brewer features one-touch brewing and automatic power-off. Better Saturation, Uniform Extraction Bonavita's wide showerhead design evenly distributes water over the coffee grounds to ensure uniform extraction. The showerhead works in harmony with our precise flat-bottomed filter basket to ensure even saturation. The result is an optimal flavor profile at your desired strength. Bundle Includes: ► 1 x Bonavita Connoisseur 8-Cup One-Touch Coffee Maker Featuring Hanging Filter Basket and Thermal Carafe, BV1901TS (SCA Certified Home Brewer) ► 2 x 4-Inch Wooden Stirring Spoons ► 1 x One-Tablespoon Plastic Clever Scoop","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YPXveCs7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonavita","source_asin":"B07JBXWFKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JBXWFKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JBXWFKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
