window.products.push({"id":664078,"name":"Trains Planes and Trucks Personalized Wall Decal Growth Chart By Olive Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jP-AtHmiL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Trains, Planes and Trucks wall decal growth chart transports any room! Features vehicles of all shapes and sizes, and your little one's name! Art Appeel growth charts are a great way to track your little one's height while adding color and style to their room! Printed on a woven polyester fabric (not inexpensive vinyl!), these adorable wall decal growth charts are removable and repositionable. This means they can move as you move--whether to a new wall, a new house, or across the world! Plus, they're easy to apply and easy to remove. Just peel off the backing and apply to any smooth, dry surface. Measures 10 in x 50 in and is marked in both inches and centimeters. All Art Appeel products are made to order and made in our studio in New Hampshire!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jP-AtHmiL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olive Kids","source_asin":"B00KLKGBH0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KLKGBH0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KLKGBH0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":664079,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock for Bedrooms, Digital Clock with Night Light 0-100% Adjustable Brightness Mirror LED Sound Activation Power-Off Memory 12/24Hr Sno","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMaLHt0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💟 2023 UPGRADED - We have listened to your feedback and have the upgraded version alarm clock with Power-Off Memory Function. Please note: This alarm clock is powered only by plugging into the USB port. 💡 NIGHT LIGHT - Not only alarm clocks for bedrooms but also a night light/bedside lamp. Soft and warm lighting gives you good sight when you move around in the dark. 🌗 ADJUSTABLE DIMMER - Two turn wheels on the back of the alarm clock, can adjust brightness of the night light and the LED digital display separately. This alarm clock is user friendly at night, which won’t be too harsh for your eyes. 🔊 SOUND ACTIVATION - Our alarm clock can choose Activated by Sound / Always On Mode. Completely dark when you sleeping, just displays the time “on demand”. 💿 MIRROR SURFACE - Mirror surface HD LED clear display for vision impaired people, easy to check time from across the room.The alarm clock can also be used as a temporary vanity mirror. ⏰ DUAL ALARM CLOCK & SNOOZE - This digital alarm clocks for bedrooms can set 2 different alarms, convenient for family members with a different schedule. Simply press the “SNOOZE” button on the top of the alarm clock to get extra 5 min sleep before it alerts again. 📅 WEEKDAY MODE - Dual alarms can set weekday mode (which will ring only on Monday to Friday) or weekend mode (which will ring on Monday to Sunday). 🔁12/24H TIME FORMAT - The alarm clock can switch 12/24Hr time format two different display modes according to your reading habits. ⚡USB POWER CORD OPERATED - ***NOT Batteries Operated*** This plug in digital clock is operated by USB power cord.(Just include USB Cable***NO Plug***) Built-in memory chip, it still has memory function after power off. Boasting USB charger port to support DC 5V/1A standard output, which can safely charge your bedside digital devices. 🎁GREAT GIFT IDEA WITH 365 DAYS PRODUCT WARRANTY - Easy use alarm clock with beautiful gift box can be a cute gift for kids or seniors, boys or girls, women or men, friends or families, boyfriend or girlfriend, also a great gift for Christmas, New Year or Birthday, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Anniversary. MefeCoorel alarm clock also provides 365 days product warranty, any questions, pls contact us via Amazon, we will response in 24H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XMaLHt0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MefeCoorel","source_asin":"B09WDPT2BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDPT2BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDPT2BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
