window.products.push({"id":664115,"name":"I.Eco.U Premium Reusable Produce Bags |Organic Cotton |Mesh Vegetable Bags |Biodegradable |Recylable |Washable |Both-Side Drawstring |Tare Weight on L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V4cSSlVxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose COTTON mesh bags?  1. Cotton is environmental friendly and it is biodegradable. Cotton can only take 6 months to decompose whereas other synthetic materials may take years. Also, as it’s non-toxic, undyed and unbleached it is safe to contain fresh produce and to be used around babies. 2. The organic fiber in cotton can be easily recycled and does not create pollution in the process. Recycled cotton can come from secondhand clothing or cotton scraps which are then spun into new yarn. This means using recycled cotton can minimize waste, save natural resources and reduce pollution from agriculture.  3. Other materials such as nylon can tear easily because of its fragile nature, which means you may have to keep buying them. On the other hand, cotton can last for many years due to its durability, and you can use cotton bags without the fear of tearing apart. Also, they can handle more weight than other synthetic materials.  4. Cotton bags are sustainable and machine-washable in cold water without worrying about damaging them, and no grocery smell will remain after a good wash. Because it is cotton, there may be a slight shrinkage in the first washing, and it’s best to cold wash the bags and air dry them to avoid further deformation.  * Please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V4cSSlVxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I.Eco.U","source_asin":"B07P9K5X1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9K5X1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9K5X1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":664116,"name":"Keurig® Platinum B70 Gourmet Single Cup Coffee & Tea Brewing System Added Value: 60 K-Cups & My K-Cup Reusable Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GSZCYWKYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Deliciously simple in less than 60 seconds! Everyone's taste in coffee is different. You love dark roast while your spouse prefers light roast. Your best friend drinks decaf, your next-door neighbor drinks tea and the kids want hot cocoa. With over 200 varieties of coffee, tea and hot cocoa to choose from, Keurig makes it possible for everyone to brew their own perfect cup in less than a minute. Unlike conventional coffee makers, there's no coffee to grind or measure, no coffee pots to clean and no soggy filters to throw away. The gourmet Keurig Ultra B70 single serve coffee system offers easy one-touch brewing with four brewing sizes, an advanced programmable LCD control center, 24-hour digital clock and removable drip tray. Includes a bonus pack of 60 K-Cups variety pack plus one My K-Cup reusable filters. Each K-Cup is sealed air-tight for freshness and is available in over 150 varieties of name brand gourmet coffee and teas to meet the most demanding taste profiles. All coffees available are 100% Arabica beans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GSZCYWKYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keurig","source_asin":"B002S51RW0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002S51RW0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002S51RW0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
