window.products.push({"id":664118,"name":"MEISTAR 14 Inch Large Wooden Gear Wall Clock,3D Exposed Golden Roman Numerals Gear Clock,Handmade Antique Wall Clocks for Kitchen,Living Room,Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dc9G6mbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thickness:About 15mm(frame thickness 9 mm+numerals thickness 6mm) Diameter:14 inch(about 34cm) Materials:Wooden MDF,painted with antique golden paint. Battery Type:Use 1 AA Carbon Zinc battery(not included).Don’t use Alkaline battery which will badly affect clock movement. Package Includes: A Gear Wall Clock A Non-trace Nail A Specification Reasons to Buy 1.High Quality Clock Movement:The silent clock movement provides you a quiet environment to sleep and work.And the high quality clock movement can guarantee time accuracy and long working life of this clock. 2.Easy to Read:The super large and legible numerals as well as long clock hands can ensure anyone to read time easily. 3.Unique Design:This wooden gear wall clock is painted with metallic-colored paint,looking as if a metal clock.Both the hollow decorative gears and large numerals present an unique 3D effect. Attentions 1.There is a detailed specification in package.Please read it carefully before using this clock. 2.Please make sure all clock hands point to 12 before using this clock,in case of causing time inaccuracy in the process of clock hands running. 3.This clock can only work well when the clock hands are parallel and straight.Because this clock has no glass cover,due to long transport,sometimes clock hands may be bent or become unparallel.Please straighten or reinstall clock hands by yourself according to the specification. 4.Please adjust time by turning the red button on the clock back.Don’t directly turn clock hands. 5.Battery is not included in the package for it is limited by international transport. 6.Because this clock is handmade,and also due to different camera lens and light brightness,there may be a slight difference between pictures and real item. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee:If,for any reason,you are not completely satisfied with your purchase,please contact us for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dc9G6mbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"meistar","source_asin":"B07TLWC4Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TLWC4Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TLWC4Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
