window.products.push({"id":664257,"name":"CZTees Classic Photo Al Green and Rose Soul Music Poster White 11 x 17 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PRX20AL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All fans will enjoy this production. When choosing one of our amazing poster images you are acquiring a piece of art history from the world of entertainment. Our exclusive posters have been high resolution scanned from original source material such as studio negatives, 35mm slides and large format transparencies to achieve the ultimate quality in the most stunning, crisp and vibrant style possible. This custom made poster will look stunning on your wall and is printed on premium quality 200 gsm archival satin photo paper. This item would make a great addition to your bar, sports room, or office and makes a great gift for fans throughout the year.This memorabilia item is a mass produced photo that bears a printed signature. The signature is part of the manufacturing process and therefore your picture is not an originally autographed item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PRX20AL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CZTees","source_asin":"B09PMLGDWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PMLGDWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PMLGDWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
