window.products.push({"id":664471,"name":"Egg Rings, 4 Pack Anti-scald Egg Molds - Stainless Steel Non-stick Round Egg Cooker Ring (Oil Brush Included) (3 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Khr0mCA7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: Our egg rings are designed with a big silicone handle to prevent burns, you can bring the egg fryer rings out easily from the pan. The foldable handle is also easy to store. Premium Material: 3-inch circle egg ring is made of BPA-free stainless steel, food-grade silicone and non-stick coating. The handle has been upgraded. Please rest assured to use these egg molds. Breakfast Tools: Egg maker ring is more than a ring for frying eggs, make English Muffin, pancake, omelet, bagel or anything you can imagine. Now start the perfect day with a sunny breakfast! Dishwasher Safe: Just a dish cloth and a little liquid dish soap, you can clean these egg shaper rings easily, put them in the dishwasher is also a good way. Easy to Use: Apply some oil to the inner wall of the egg ring, this is a key step for non-stick purpose. ➡ Put the frying egg ring on a flat pan, add some oil into the ring mold with low heat, this will keep eggs in good shape without leaking out. ➡ Break an egg into the ring. ➡ Cook the egg with low heat over 3 minutes. Congratulations! You get a perfect egg.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Khr0mCA7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tibeha","source_asin":"B08GP18VTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GP18VTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GP18VTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
