window.products.push({"id":664480,"name":"Peeking Family of 9 Personalized Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I5sIz9z7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create personalized Christmas ornaments for your tree this year and enjoy them for years to come as you watch your family grow. Or, give personalized ornaments as gifts to everyone on your list to remind them of special moments from the years gone by. As children grow, grandchildren arrive and new holiday traditions begin, your family, friends and loved ones will cherish the unique history and timeline that custom Christmas ornaments pass down for all to see. Traditionally, ornaments placed on the Christmas tree usually consisted of plain, round, glass balls or icicles. Many different styles of ornaments are available, making the tree decorating much more personal. Personalized ornaments make a terrific keepsake and gifts personalized will be treasured over the years. Whether you choose to give an ornament that represents something a loved one really enjoys, or an ornament with their name on it, personalized ornaments are a terrific way to show you care. Everyone has a hobby or favorite sport that we are sure to have an ornament for, or celebrate occasions with ornaments for newlyweds, baby's and new parents, or wedding anniversaries. High-quality porcelain ornaments are the perfect gift for kids of all ages and adults. Fun to hang and cute to look at for years to come. Each ornament comes in a special box and is ready to hang.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I5sIz9z7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polar X","source_asin":"B07YD4C2NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD4C2NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD4C2NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
