window.products.push({"id":664653,"name":"4 Pack of Christmas Advent Candles, 3 Purple and 1 Pink Taper Candles, Christmas Products, Seasonal Celebration Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612A6DiV2UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing says advent more than this beautiful set of 10\" taper candles. This is truly a beautiful set of 4 advent tapers, including 3 purple and 1 pink candles, made of 100% natural wax, and stand at 10 inch height and 7/8 base. Each candle can burn 9-10 hours. Something About Advent Candles: The advent wreath is the traditional centerpiece/must-have during Christmas season. An advent candle is lit on each of the four Sundays preceding Christmas. The first purple candle represents hope. The second purple candle represents peace. The pink candle, generally lit on the third Sunday of Advent, represents joy. The final purple candle represents love. Package includes: 3 * Purple Candles1 * Pink Candle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612A6DiV2UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anmeng","source_asin":"B08GPCTFQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GPCTFQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GPCTFQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
