window.products.push({"id":664655,"name":"PackIt Freezable Grocery Shopping Bag with Zip Closure, Fresh Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714WLqO6x8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the checkout aisle to your kitchen, this genius freezable grocery bag is the best solution to keep meat, dairy, fruits and veggies cool and safe. This is the only reusable grocery shopping bag features PackIt's groundbreaking cooling technology. The secret is in the base of the bag itself! Non-toxic freezable gel is built into the base of the bag, which eliminates the need for separate freezable blue ice packs or gel packs. To use, simply fold PackIt's Freezable Grocery Bag flat and store it in the freezer overnight (12 hours). In the morning, the base of the grocery bag will be completely frozen and ready to chill food and drinks for hours. The most temperature-sensitive items, such as meat, dairy, poultry, and frozen foods, stay chilled on the bottom of the bag, while the top has plenty of room for less perishable foods. The top zipper closure locks in cool, dry air and two top handles make this grocery bag easy to grab and go. Use the freezable grocery bag instead of a bulky car cooler, or for a trip to the beach or sporting event. This reusable bag is a must-have for families on the go and residents of communities with plastic bag bans. It folds up neatly, even when frozen, for compact storage. This soft sided freezable reusable grocery bag is made with nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the grocery bag is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. This shopping bag measures 14.5 inches tall, 12.5 inches wide and 7.5 inches deep (while open). When folded, it measures 7.25 inches long, 12.75 inches wide and 2.25 inches tall for easy storage in the freezer. Simple care: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714WLqO6x8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B01MT9R0A2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT9R0A2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT9R0A2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
