window.products.push({"id":664675,"name":"Cross Handmade Tile Coasters (Set of Four)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812NorYBYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four ceramic tile coasters are perfect to add a little style to any room, or a gift for a loved one! These coasters are made by wrapping high quality paper around the ceramic tile, not by gluing the design to just the top of the tile. This gives my coasters a much more finished look and makes them more attractive, since there is no visible tile showing. Each and every coaster is then backed with cork to protect furniture against scratches, and sealed with multiple coats of varnish to protect them against water damage. Product Details: *4.25\" X 4.25\" * Set of four ceramic tile coasters * Varnish seal to waterproof coasters * Cork on the bottom won't scratch furniture * Made and ready to ship * Great for use with any beverage * Easily cleaned with a damp cloth As they are somewhat fragile, great care goes into packaging your coasters for shipping!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812NorYBYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Coaster Attic","source_asin":"B00LXRZOB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LXRZOB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LXRZOB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
