window.products.push({"id":664750,"name":"Ever Bamboo Guitar Dehumidifier Bag Set w/Natural Bamboo Charcoal (3-50 g, 2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZJpSFyj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Harvested from the rapidly growing Moso Bamboo, bamboo charcoal is a naturally occurring porous structure with millions of microscopic holes pulling and absorbing odour and moisture from the air. Bamboo charcoal is natural, sustainable, reusable and recyclable. Due to non-toxic and eco-friendly attributes, bamboo charcoal is literally nature’s way of eliminating life’s stinky stuff! Much like a wooden door or window frame, a wooden instrument is prone to swelling and warping during extended periods of exposure to high humidity. A gloss finish might protect the instrument from impact or liquids, but it is NOT a vapor barrier. It is critical to stay in tune with the needs of your instruments and protect them from the damaging and irreversible effects of humidity and moisture. Ever Bamboo products have been used and tested to effectively aid in the process of keeping your solid wood instrument at the proper acceptable humidity range of 40-60%. Offering both protection from humidity as well as aiding in de-humidifying an exposed instrument, Ever Bamboo's product are simple and effective and will keep you from strumming the blues. We think It’s instrumental for your instrument! INSTRUCTIONS: When storing guitar in case, place 2 pouches by the body of guitar , and one pouch by the neck. Pouches need to be in open sections of the case and/or instrument to be effective (NOT in accessory case). Keep in mind, an instrument that has seen extreme levels of humidity for an extended period of time will require several weeks of consistent restore its proper humidity level. We recommend using a hygrometer to monitor relative humidity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZJpSFyj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ever Bamboo","source_asin":"B01D9P1KNI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D9P1KNI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D9P1KNI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
