window.products.push({"id":664771,"name":"JUO Sunrise Alarm Clock Wake Up Light Smart Digital Alarm Clock for Kids Sunrise Alarm Clock for Bedroom Radio Alarm Bedside Reading Light RGB Ambient","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nd3gMutGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌅【Sleep Revolution】 Do you have such troubles? After waking up by the ordinary alarm clock, your heart beating very fast, and you'll fall ito a bad mood for all day. The stress of work make you feel anxiety, very hard to have a good sleep quality, and easy to get fatigue? If you have similar troubles, our sunrise alarm clock will be your best choice! 🌅【Gently Wake Up with Sunrise Glow】 A multifunctional Sunrise Alarm Clock. When the wake up alarm goes off, the lights will gradually brighten like a sunrise. Alarm clock with sunrise simulation to help you gently wake up from sweet dreams. This wake up light alarm clock has a full screen LED display, you can adjust the brightness of the display by pressing the dimming button, there are three brightness levels for you to choose. You could dim the brightness of display to have a good rest at night, and brighten the display during the day to see the time more clearly. 🌅【Fall Asleep with Sunset Glow】 Our sleep aid function of this sunrise alarm clock can help you fall asleep quickly with the peaceful music, you can set a 10-240min countdown time, choose your favorite music and light color, there are 10 peaceful natural sound and 14 different ambient RGB lights for you to choose. Accompanied by the smooth natural sound, you can relax your mind, relieve stress, and fall asleep with a pleasant and relaxed mood. 🌅【Dual Alarm Clock】10 kinds of natural music, let you wake up naturally in peaceful nature sound. There are two alarm clocks setting of this sunrise alarm clock, you can set different times respectively, you can choose different working time periods for the two alarm clocks, there are three time periods for you to choose(Mon.-Fri./Mon.-Sun./Sat.-Sun.) which can meet all your needs. Gently press the snooze button and you can get extra 5 minutes to sleep, after 5 minutes the alarm will go off again. 🌅【Rexing FM Time】Turn on FM radio of this sunrise alarm clock, expand the radio antenna, you can choose the automatic search function, the search range is 76-108 Hz, when the automatic search is completed, the first searched channel will be played, you can skip to the previous or next channel by long pressing the Volume+/- buttons, or searche channels by turning the buttons manually. 🌅【Hassle-Free Replacement】 - NO NEED TO RETURN! JUO focuses on to provide more advanced sunrise alarm clock. Producing better lights is our primary goal. JUO light is backed by full 2-Year Warranty with the 30-day trial. We also provide free Lifetime Technical Support. Write to us via Amazon anytime. We will assist you within 24 hours. If there are any product failures, it comes with a FULL REFUND within 30 DAYS. Your 100% satisfaction is our primary responsibility!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nd3gMutGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUO","source_asin":"B09XWMBXMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XWMBXMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XWMBXMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
