window.products.push({"id":664825,"name":"Larrabee Ceramics Handmade American Pottery Coffee Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0iMMdxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Utah-based Larrabee Ceramics creates functional pottery with colorful, eye-catching glazes. The tools of the trade include a potter's wheel, Ram press, extruder, and slab roller, all used to create unique pottery that brings beauty to everyday meals and special occasions. Fired in gas kilns, the work is heavy and durable, safe for microwave, oven, and dishwasher. Larrabee Ceramics glazes are spontaneous and dynamic, making each piece unique. Color names are approximations, and hues will vary. For instance, Red/Multi may run the gamut from rusty-red to pinkish-red. For this reason, color and textural matches cannot be guaranteed. The Mauve/Green and Brown/Multi glazes sometimes come out of the kiln thicker than the others, with more body, dimension, and a mix of flat and glossy surfaces. They can resemble icing that's dribbled down the sides of a cupcake. The remaining glazes are smoother and have an overall glossy surface. Please appreciate the individuality of Larrabee Ceramics pottery as confirmation of its artisan origin versus the matchy-matchy look of machine-made, assembly-line products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0iMMdxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Larrabee Ceramics","source_asin":"B00OV99GUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OV99GUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OV99GUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":664826,"name":"Zavor EZLock Stove Top Pressure Cooker 12 Quart & Pressure Canner - Stainless Steel, Multi Pressure Levels, Easy Locking, Induction Ready, 4 Jar Canni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K8ry1l0gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY & SAFE LOCKING - Thanks to the Universal Locking Mechanism the lid easily locks into place with the turn of a knob. It will clamp onto the pot from any position and, if pressure is built inside the pot, will not unlock VERSATILE & RELIABLE - The Pressure Settings, which range from HIGH Pressure at 15 PSI to LOW Pressure at 10 PSI, provide the flexibility to Pressure Cook even the most delicate dishes FASTER THAN OTHER COOKERS - Pressure Cookers prepare food 3x faster than any other cooking tool. They save you time and energy in the kitchen and produce a more flavorful and nutritious meal BUILT TO LAST & FOR CONVENIENCE - Constructed of high-quality stainless steel and compatible with all domestic stoves including gas, electric, ceramic and induction. The unit itself is not electrically powered INCLUDES - Top-of-the-line 12.7 Qt Stove-top Pressure Cooker & Canner that fits up to Four (4) 1Qt Mason Jars or up to Five (5) Pint Mason Jars, Quick Guide, User's Manual, Digital Cookbook and Stainless Steel Steamer Basket (jars, canning rack and other canning tools NOT INCLUDED). The unit is not compatible with pressure gauges | 10-year warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K8ry1l0gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAVOR","source_asin":"B07HJ7Y6T1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJ7Y6T1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJ7Y6T1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
