window.products.push({"id":664884,"name":"StarDFC French Bread Baking Pan Nonstick Perforated Baguette Pan 4Loaves Loaf Bake Mold Toast Cooking Bakers Molding Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MtKLNehWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No need to go to the French Bakery to enjoy some good french style bread! Do it Yourself! Our Baking Pan has what it takes to bake perfect baguettes. It is designed in a non-stick coating made from specialized food quality carbon steel, safe to use and resistant to up to 500°F.The perforations at the bottom of the pan are useful to bake the loaves of bread evenly. 4 Wells to cook 4 loaves at once! Size:15\"\"(L) X 13\"\"(W) X 0.98\"\" (Thickness), the width of each gutter is 2.8 -------- Baguette Recipe --------- Prep Time 30 mins Cook Time 40 mins Resting Time 2 hrs Ingredients 1.75 ounces warm water 1 1/2 teaspoons active dry yeast 16 ounces bread flour 2 teaspoons kosher salt 10 ounces cool water Instructions 1.Measure the warm water in a small bowl and sprinkle the yeast on top. Set aside. 2.Measure the bread flour into a large bowl and stir in the salt. 3.Make a well in the center of the flour mixture, and stir in the dissolved yeast. 4.Add the cool water, a little at a time, while stirring, just until a shaggy dough has formed (you may not need to use all of the water). 5.Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and allow it to rest for 30 minutes. 6.Transfer the dough to a lightly floured work surface, and gently press it into a rectangle and fold into thirds. Turn 90 degrees and repeat.  7.Place the dough in a large oiled bowl, and cover with plastic wrap. Allow it to rise in a warm place for 1 to 2 hours, or until doubled in bulk. 8.Divide the dough into 4 equal portions, and shape each one into a long loaf (about 15-inches long and 1 1/2-inches in diameter), with pointed ends.  9.Place the loaves on a floured towel, cover with oiled plastic wrap, and allow to rise for 30 to 45 minutes. 10.Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F, and place a pan of water on the bottom rack. 11.Uncover the baguettes and transfer to lightly\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MtKLNehWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarDFC","source_asin":"B0882NN7G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0882NN7G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0882NN7G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":664885,"name":"The Stand Off by Sylvia Masek, 8x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Si4JrbnjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a cat and mouse staring at eachother. Sylvia Masek attended Kent State University and walked away with a BFA in Visual Communication Design with a concentration in illustration. In 2002, she launched the Power of Whodo, an illustration studio specializing in whimsical artwork that evokes a sense of childhood wonder and innocence. She has enjoyed a measure of success since then, illustrating children's books, growth charts, kids room art and public pieces dispayed in Cleveland, Akron and Columbus, OH. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Si4JrbnjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0YZBDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0YZBDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0YZBDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
