window.products.push({"id":664901,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld Electric Milk Coffee Foam Maker with 3 Whisks, Powerful 3 Speeds Rechargable Coffee Mixer for Coffee, Lattes, Cappuccino, Matcha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618-f-gy78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rich Foam: WanderLand Milk frother handheld is very suitable for rapid production of foam. You can make delicious lattes, milkshakes, hot chocolate, matcha, cappuccino or other drinks, powders and high-quality egg mixers at home without going out. 3-Speed Adjustable: Our coffee frother handheld/ electric whisk has three buttons of high/middle/low on the handheld frother main unit for you to control, in order to achieve the ideal foaming effect. The higher speed you choose for milk frother handheld, the less time you will spend, and the thicker foam you will create in frother electric. 3 Replaceable Stainless Whisks: The handheld frother/coffee mixer is equipped with 3 high-quality replaceable stainless steel milk frother whisk heads, which can satisfy your various demands. It can be used to froth milk, coffee or cream, whisk eggs, mix protein powder with healthy drinks, blend drinks, powdered chocolate beverages and so on. Milk Frother Rechargable:Our frother for coffee is designed with USB charging, which is more environmentally friendly and lighter than battery types, allowing you to charge it anytime, anywhere without changing batteries. The built-in battery has a capacity of 1200mAh. After being fully charged for 6 hours, the coffee frother handheld can be used for 1 month or more. Easy to Use & Clean: Press the speed button to select the appropriate whisking speed. After using, put the stainless cold foam milk frother whisks in a glass of hot water or under the fresh running water, then flush to clean it. The stainless steel milk frother rechargeable can be quickly cleaned.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618-f-gy78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WanderLand","source_asin":"B08ZJCDQRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJCDQRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJCDQRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":664902,"name":"Jumbo Toy Hammock - Organize stuffed animals or children's toys with the mesh hammock. Looks great with any décor while neatly organizing kid’s toys a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnETq-Z+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Children’s stuffed animals can easily take over their bed, bedroom, and playroom, so parents need an easy storage solution. The Jumbo Toy Hammock is a novel toy way to hold and organize kids’ toys, pillows, stuffed animals, and other items, in an attractive way that becomes part of the décor. You can also use it in the bathroom to store bathtub toys, giving them a unique way to drain and dry out until their next use. The pink mesh material is durable enough to hold 30 or more items at a time. Just string it across a corner, like over their bed where little ones will enjoy having their stuffed animal friends close, or along any wall where they provide a colorful decoration. It’s easy to attach to any wall with the hook hardware included or use adhesive wall strips. The elastic binding can expand up to 5.5 feet. Because of our mesh construction, kids and parents can see all the toys that live in the hammock, making it easy to choose which ones will come out to play. It’s also easy to store them again when playtime is over, encouraging kids to help with the clean-up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnETq-Z+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handy Laundry","source_asin":"B01N7I763T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7I763T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7I763T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
