window.products.push({"id":664957,"name":"Creative Courtyard 12 Pack Mess Free Home Fragrance No Melt Wax Tarts (Winter Rose)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-tfSm7DNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These tarts never melt. That means there is no messy clean up when you are done with them. It also means that you can change fragrances at any time because the tarts never get hot. With a normal wax melt, you have to wait for the wax to harden again and then scrape it out of your warmer, which is tedious. You can pick these tarts up at any time. They will be warm, but they will never be hot, which is great for use around kids or pets. You also don’t have to worry about spilling drips of hot wax on your furniture or floors, because there is no hot wax. You can use these tarts with any wax warmer that you already own. The fragrances are so inviting and the technology of the tart allows for an even and slow release resulting in a longer lasting scent. These innovative little tarts were invented and produced in the USA, so that’s always a plus. Winter Rose is crisp floral scent that helps you to remember, in the winter, far beneath the bitter snow, lies the seed that with the sun’s love, in the spring, becomes a rose. Technically speaking, thats a song by Bette Midler, but that's also how Winter Rose makes you feel. Here's the real detailed info on the fragrance: Top: Bergamot, Lemon Sugar, Geranium, Snow Accord Mid: Winter Rose, Pink Peony, Peach Nectar Base: Patchouli, White Amber, Tonka, Musk Basic: Floriental – Vanilla - Rose","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-tfSm7DNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Courtyard","source_asin":"B077SKNW4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-664957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077SKNW4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077SKNW4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
